45
00:02:25.360 --> 00:02:30.040
So you may or may not be familiar with the iOS ecosystem specifically.

46
00:02:30.200 --> 00:02:35.000
But some things I want to call out that are quite different than a lot of web

47
00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:38.120
and full stack frameworks that exist out there is Apple

48
00:02:38.120 --> 00:02:41.600
and Android are fundamentally closed source ecosystems.

49
00:02:41.760 --> 00:02:44.280
IOS more so than Android.

50
00:02:44.280 --> 00:02:48.680
And this, you can imagine, affects how these foundation models are trained.

51
00:02:49.600 --> 00:02:52.880
So they just have less access to the underlying code.

52
00:02:53.280 --> 00:02:56.880
There are proprietary operating systems and platform APIs,

53
00:02:57.240 --> 00:03:00.440
and the tooling and the languages that are used.

54
00:03:00.440 --> 00:03:04.840
I've tried to show all of the nice icons here are very specific

