00:13:15.560 --> 00:13:18.480
I would not pick it if I'm doing high performance

229
00:13:18.480 --> 00:13:20.720
scrolling infinite feeds, right.

230
00:13:20.720 --> 00:13:25.280
You're you're having to go back and forth across a JavaScript JavaScript bridge.

